  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>БРАЗИЛЬСКИЙ</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">КРЭФТ</span> <span style=\"color:#236fa1\">АВТОМОБИЛИ</span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>ВНИМАНИЕ</strong>:</span></h1><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">ЭТОТ МОДПАК ЗАВИСИТ ОТ IMMERSIVE VEHICLES.</span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">&nbsp;ЕГО НЕОБХОДИМО УСТАНОВИТЬ ПЕРВОЕ.</span></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">(ЭТОТ МОДПАК ЗАВИСИТ ОТ IMMERSIVE VEHICLES.<br>ЕГО НЕОБХОДИМО УСТАНОВИТЬ ПЕРВОЕ.)</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">СКАЧАТЬ:&nbsp;</span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator</a></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>ЦЕЛЬ ЭТОГО МОДПАКА — ПРЕДСТАВИТЬ ТРАНСПОРТНЫЕ СРЕДСТВА, ОБЫЧНО ПРОДАВАЮЩИЕСЯ В БРАЗИЛИИ.</em></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">(ЭТОТ МОДПАК ПРЕДНАЗНАЧЕН ДЛЯ ПРЕДСТАВЛЕНИЯ ТРАНСПОРТНЫХ СРЕДСТВ, ОБЫЧНО ПРОДАВАЮЩИХСЯ В БРАЗИЛИИ.)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rCxmPCASpI0?si=pZCLMquKK7f51W5k\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Новые добавленные транспортные средства:&nbsp;</p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">(Новые добавленные транспортные средства)</h5><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_c8b4eea8-da4c-40a3-a973-3ed1847917ad.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Гольф</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_27630781-38bb-45d8-aa00-4985f6586d96.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Нивус</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_38509f30-9133-4290-bb83-08b6a83cb32a.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Велосипед</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_23415b1a-0bda-4042-a42c-c567b7b59308.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_7dd928fd-0da1-48ff-86d4-aa74c5281f7c.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_a16e0ad6-70ad-43fa-b94c-f23fb29eeb91.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_179673ff-2c3d-48fc-8257-279f00560ab1.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_a19246ec-bfb8-4ca7-9d97-01c6a57a5d1f.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_512562e2-cb37-4bd4-99fe-737b6a992506.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Fiat Uno</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_90b4c626-2afb-4426-b234-2430248751b0.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_a3c6e57d-7d82-46af-a4ea-011de5db1b73.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_a8054f97-9167-40cc-acb0-546292cc50ed.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Gol GTI</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_ced3fdc1-df90-45b4-b835-2bd2563b636e.png\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_56f5688b-e179-43f5-bd7d-413916d4b323.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Opala Standard</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_4b46fef1-c8b7-4268-b458-e036fc02b523.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Opala SS&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_9c74f9f5-5c1a-4a8b-93a3-fe075fbb7009.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_df33e0cc-1314-4694-9964-8210eaaadc8c.jpg\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Opala SS Rusty</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_dc07d92c-f2d5-4309-9e81-783d43fe548a.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Opala Turbo Upgrade</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_6fadfa82-9d0d-4994-9ca8-9f208042e6f5.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_a805e751-82dc-4c12-92d9-ce9ec7ff18fa.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Двигатель, поддающийся окраске</p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">(Paintable Engine)</h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_1513ddab-c34f-442f-a6cf-4f22ee68ff2e.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">RAM 1500</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_46840758-79e7-42be-8ede-0fd5d7d691ad.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_57ffbdd3-77a4-496e-b1ee-2631449b4ecf.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_d7349cb8-4915-4672-bcf7-3159ec73042c.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Добавлен прицеп</p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">(Добавлен автомобильный прицеп)</h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_23a38a19-da7c-4d18-8f81-771bba559bfa.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1004372/description_e6de8159-8d95-4156-8b4c-e002d53a80f9.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f5ec2b3c-41d2-490a-935d-9f1491e4163c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d1bece58-4ecb-4950-a4f9-42ca4847c24e.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f50336e2-2573-423c-9195-00c83814467b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2b34c8b6-6f52-46a1-942f-2ad778eccab0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_87e5f970-472e-4952-917b-0089a319dff4.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7e82b887-a2fa-4eec-96ab-2ef3baf502c5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">S10 ПОЛНАЯ ВЕРСИЯ</h4><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">(S10 COMPLETE VERSION)</h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_11f207f5-d30d-4fce-83b5-ce528653c0de.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bc0eff9d-0cb6-4439-9e35-a8a8daa144a6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">С РАЗЛИЧНЫМИ ЭЛЕМЕНТАМИ КОСТЮМА</h4><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">(WITH VARIOUS CUSTOMIZATION PARTS)</h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f9c2db49-819c-4120-ad05-56c413f97fb6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">S10 БАЗОВАЯ ВЕРСИЯ</h4><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">(S10 BASIC VERSION)</h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_35047f58-f60e-4c55-b7ba-1312cf3a4048.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b0d510c2-d180-4b63-bb8f-d6fcf74cf3dd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">S10 ПОЛИЦЕЙСКАЯ ВЕРСИЯ С ВОЗМОЖНОСТЬЮ КОСТЮМИЗАЦИИ СКИНА</h4><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">(S10 POLICE VERSION WITH POSSIBILITY OF SKIN CUSTOMIZATION)</h5><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">ВНИМАНИЕ</h2><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">(ATTENTION)</h5><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">ВСЕГДА ИСПОЛЬЗУЙТЕ ПОСЛЕДНЮЮ ВЕРСИЮ IMMERSIVE VEHICLES, ЧТОБЫ ИЗБЕЖАТЬ БОЛЬШИХ БАГОВ.</h3><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">(ВСЕГДА ИСПОЛЬЗУЙТЕ ПОСЛЕДНЮЮ ВЕРСИЮ IMMERSIVE VEHICLES, ЧТОБЫ ИЗБЕЖАТЬ ГЛАВНЫХ ОШИБОК.)</h5><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">МОД НАХОДИТСЯ В НАЧАЛЬНОЙ СТАДИИ, СОДЕРЖИТ ОШИБКИ.</h1><h5 style=\"text-align:center\">(МОД В НАЧАЛЬНОЙ СТАДИИ, СОДЕРЖИТ ОШИБКИ.)</h5><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
